.card-widget.card-today(data-sidebar-today)
  .item-headline
    i.fas.fa-chart-pie
    span 一年进度
  .today-date
    strong(data-today-day) --
    div
      span(data-today-month) ----年--月
      small(data-today-weekday) 星期-
  .today-progress
    .today-progress-copy
      span 本年进度
      strong(data-year-progress) 0%
    .today-progress-track
      i(data-year-progress-bar)
  p(data-today-greeting) 今天也留下一点值得回看的记录。
